Model Room workstream index

01_MODEL_ROOM_FOUNDATION.todo - DONE: original static inspection workspace,
agent brief workflow, procedural box, Blender-compatible export and local hosting.

02_DEVELOPMENT_LEDGER.todo is the perpetual development journal, not a finite issue.
Each workstream retains Status, Milestone, Dependencies, Purpose, Tasks,
Acceptance criteria, Completion evidence and Completion log.
Technical completion is distinct from human aesthetic approval/public deployment.
